      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i've also been seeing a lot of stuff online about people being worried that these cities are basically a way for the govt to restrict movement or trap people in their zones. it sounds a bit extreme but it's definitely getting a lot of traction. is there any truth to that or is it just nonsense?",
